<p class="k">Agent Service Trust Ratings · daily changes</p>
<h1>Rating actions</h1>
<p style="color:#9aa4b2">Every day the trust index is recomputed; when a service changes tier or outlook, that is a
rating action. Tier changes lead; outlook revisions follow. Only services with a published page qualify.
